rule: ASSERT_REMOVED
title: a no-op method appended under an unchanged method's name is an in-place rewrite of it
origin: #424 R4, ruling 424 Q1 (b) - the earlier method is not collected, so the later one pairs with the base test; v0.8.0 reported nothing
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


